#. i18n: file kadddevicedlg.ui line 242
#: rc.cpp:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>Please enter the desired subnetmask for the interface here.</p>\n"
"<p>For small private networks, 255.255.255.0 will most often be a reasonable "
"default value.</p>\n"
"<p>This field will change from a popup box to a combo box as soon as you enable "
"the advanced settings below.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>請在此輸入界面要用的子網絡遮罩。</p>\n"
"<p>對於小型的私人網絡， 255.255.255.0 會是很合理的預設值。</p>\n"
"<p>如你啟用下面的進階設置，此欄位會由彈出式選單變成組合式選單。</p>"

#. i18n: file kadddevicedlg.ui line 284
#: rc.cpp:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "Netmask:"
msgstr "網絡遮罩:"

#. i18n: file kadddevicedlg.ui line 287
#: rc.cpp:85 rc.cpp:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The netmask defines a range of IP numbers which will build a subnet inside the "
"network."
msgstr "網絡遮罩定義在網絡內建立子網絡的 IP 數字範圍。"

#. i18n: file kadddevicedlg.ui line 301
#: rc.cpp:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "IP address for the network device"
msgstr "網絡裝置的 IP 位址"

#. i18n: file kadddevicedlg.ui line 311
#: rc.cpp:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>Here you should enter the IP address for the network interface.</p>\n"
"<p>Please note: If your network is connected to the internet, you should only "
"enter IP addresses you have been given by your provider.</p>\n"
"<p>Otherwise, you should enter one of the IP addresses which are explicitly "
"reserved for private use.</p>\n"
"<p>Most small private networks use class C networks, which allow up to 255 "
"computers in your network. So simply use addresses like 192.168.1.1, "
"192.168.1.2, 192.168.1.171 and so on for your computers.</p>\n"
"<p>Cass C networks: 192.168.0.0 to 192.168.255.25, for example 192.168.0.13.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>Class B networks: 172.16.0.0 to 172.31.255.255, for example 172.28.2.5</p>\n"
"<p>Class A networks: 10.0.0.0 to 10.255.255.255, for example 10.5.12.14</p>\n"
"<p>Please ensure that all IP addresses you give to your computers are unique; "
"you will have many problems if the same address is assigned to more than one "
"network device.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>在此你應輸入網絡界面的 IP 位址。</p>\n"
"<p>請注意：如你的網絡連接互聯網，你只應輸入供應商提供的 IP 位址。</p>\n"
"<p>否則你應輸入專供私人使用的 IP 位址。</p>\n"
"<p>絕大部份小型私人網絡使用 C 類（class C）網絡；它容許你的網絡有多至 255 部電腦。你的電腦只需使用如 192.168.1.1 "
"、192.168.1.2 、192.168.1.171 等位址。</p>\n"
"<p>C 類（Class C）網絡: 192.168.0.0 至 192.168.255.255, 例如 192.168.0.13 。</p>\n"
"<p>B 類（Class B）網絡: 172.16.0.0 至 172.31.255.255, 例如 172.28.2.5</p>\n"
"<p>A 類（Class A）網絡: 10.0.0.0 至 10.255.255.255, 例如 10.5.12.14</p>\n"
"<p>請確定分派給每部電腦的 IP 位址都是獨一無二的；如同一位址分派給多於一部網絡裝置將導致很多問題。</p>"

